{"route":{"id":"17449","name":"Ruta a les Planasses i Salpatx","intro":"Aquesta <strong>ruta familiar</strong> ens portarà un dels racons més atractius i amb un paisatge més espectacular del municipi de l’Escala. <strong>Penya-segats espectaculars, plantes singulars, dunes litorals i pinedes variades</strong>, són els escenaris que ens oferirà aquesta interessant excursió familiar.","tipus":"Circular antihorari","dificultat":"Familiar","durada":"1 hora 16 minuts","desnivell":"82.00 meters","distancia":"4.42 km","tema":"Flora i fauna, Paisatgístic","imgs":["n17449_1.jpg","n17449_2.jpg","n17449_3.jpg","n17449_4.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-girona/rutes-senderisme-parc-natural-del-montgri-illes-medes-i-baix-ter/ruta-les-planasses-i-salpatx","track":[[42.11616,3.15165],[42.11615,3.15173],[42.11624,3.15177],[42.1163,3.15184],[42.11631,3.15198],[42.11637,3.15205],[42.1165,3.15202],[42.11659,3.15204],[42.11662,3.15204],[42.11666,3.15197],[42.11671,3.15196],[42.11691,3.1519],[42.11713,3.15184],[42.11744,3.15172],[42.11755,3.1517],[42.11769,3.1516],[42.11782,3.15159],[42.11795,3.15158],[42.11805,3.15156],[42.11813,3.15151],[42.11821,3.15146],[42.1183,3.15145],[42.11838,3.15147],[42.11845,3.1515],[42.11856,3.15154],[42.11866,3.15155],[42.11873,3.15156],[42.1188,3.15157],[42.11889,3.15158],[42.11899,3.15162],[42.11903,3.15173],[42.11909,3.15181],[42.11913,3.15191],[42.11914,3.15202],[42.1191,3.15215],[42.11906,3.15224],[42.11903,3.15234],[42.119,3.15249],[42.11895,3.15263],[42.11886,3.1527],[42.1188,3.15279],[42.11873,3.15285],[42.11867,3.15292],[42.1186,3.15299],[42.11852,3.15301],[42.11852,3.15297],[42.11845,3.15306],[42.11836,3.1531],[42.11828,3.15315],[42.1183,3.15313],[42.11826,3.15325],[42.11821,3.15336],[42.11816,3.15348],[42.11809,3.15355],[42.11803,3.15361],[42.11797,3.15369],[42.1179,3.15379],[42.11785,3.15388],[42.11785,3.15396],[42.1178,3.15408],[42.11772,3.15418],[42.11764,3.15426],[42.11758,3.15442],[42.11755